  <div className="delivery-rule-sources"><a className="delivery-rule-official-link" href="https://www.indiapost.gov.in/rti/pincodelist" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Official India Post PIN-code lists</a><a className="delivery-rule-official-link" href="https://data.gov.in/resource/all-india-pincode-directory-till-last-month" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Government PIN directory (district and state)</a><small>Postal data helps identify and verify a PIN area only; it is not proof that a courier accepts that destination.</small></div>
